sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant APP as Flutter app / kiosk
    participant API as WebServer (Javalin :8080)
    participant QMS as QueueManagementService
    participant QED as QueueEntryDAO
    participant EVD as QueueEventDAO
    participant DB as hospital.db

    rect rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06)
    Note over APP,DB: join queue — POST /api/ticket
    APP->>API: POST /api/ticket {dept, service, priority}
    API->>QMS: joinQueue(entry)
    QMS->>QMS: queueDate = today, status = Waiting
    QMS->>QED: findAll() (O(N) history scan)
    QED-->>QMS: all entries
    QMS->>QMS: queueNumber = max+1 per (dept, date)
    QMS->>QMS: qrToken = UUID v4
    QMS->>QED: save(entry)
    QED->>DB: INSERT INTO queue_entries
    DB-->>QED: generated queue_id
    QMS->>EVD: logEvent(JOINED)
    EVD->>DB: INSERT INTO queue_events
    QMS-->>API: entry (201 + queueNumber + qrToken)
    API-->>APP: JSON ticket
    end

    rect rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.06)
    Note over APP,DB: track — polled every ~3 s
    loop polling
        APP->>API: GET /api/ticket/{token}
        API->>QMS: getTicketStatus(qrToken)
        QMS->>QED: find by qr_token + active queue
        QMS-->>API: patientsAhead, est. wait, current #
        API-->>APP: TicketStatus JSON
    end
    end

    rect rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.06)
    Note over APP,DB: serve — POST /api/queue/{dept}/advance
    APP->>API: POST /api/queue/{deptId}/advance
    API->>QMS: getActiveQueue(dept) → first Waiting
    API->>QMS: advance(queueId)
    QMS->>DB: Waiting → Checked In → In Consultation → Completed (one hop per call, audit each)
    API-->>APP: updated TicketStatus
    end
